  "description": "Stage 2 of the tri-lateral pipeline. Rapid mineral identification specialist \u2014 returns ranked candidate list with confidence scores, key field tests, hardness range, streak color, and cleavage notes for each candidate. Recommends Deep Analysis when confidence is medium-to-low.",
